# Given: the probe functions, whose inner raises on an empty argument, and two parameters
# When: the inner is nested in the outer with a ? and the statement is EXECUTEd twice
# Then: the inner has one init per EXECUTE and no deinit, so the component cannot be
#       uninstalled; on 8.0 the outer leaks too (see the per-major counts)
--- errors, in statement order ---
ERROR 3200 (HY000) at line 13: probe_raise_volatile UDF failed; no value for the argument: the server evaluated this function before its bound parameter had one
ERROR 3200 (HY000) at line 14: probe_raise_volatile UDF failed; no value for the argument: the server evaluated this function before its bound parameter had one
--- after the case ---
probe_counts: {"probe_outer":{"init":0,"deinit":0},"probe_raise_const":{"init":0,"deinit":0},"probe_raise_volatile":{"init":2,"deinit":0}}
uninstall probe: refused: ERROR 3538 (HY000) at line 1: De-initialization method provided by component 'probe' failed.
restarted: probe re-loaded at server start
